    {
      "name": "Dark Light Blessing",
      "item": "necrozma",
      "npc": "ampelo",
      "color": "#8f7cf0",
      "summary": "",
      "howToGet": "",
      "stages": [
        {
          "title": "Stage 1: Acquaintances",
          "symbol": "",
          "text": "* Allows the acquaintance to consume light from a singular, stable, living Pokémon to drain their strength and make it their own for single battle, the strength returning to the drained Pokémon once said battle concludes. The draining requires active channeling and will be canceled if interrupted by any means.\n   * To Acquaintance: +1 Stage ATK & Sp A\n   * To Drained: -1 Stage ATK & Sp A\n* If in a Twilight Island dungeon and out of danger, call upon this blessing to escape to `[TWILIGHT ISLAND TOWN NAME]`.\n* Being K.O.'d will return you to the nearest safe space with your items intact."
        },
        {
          "title": "Stage 2: Friends",
          "symbol": "",
          "text": "* Allows the friend’s consumption of light to also steal a move from the drained, preventing them from using that move, but letting the friend use it instead. The friend must have the parts needed to use the move, and the move cannot be a legendary signature or custom move.\n* If in a Twilight Island dungeon, call upon this blessing to escape with your team (optional) to `[TWILIGHT ISLAND TOWN NAME]`.\n* Being K.O.'d will return you to the nearest safe space with your items intact."
        }
      ]
    },
